{
  "_comment": [
    "OBS scene-collection template for the station. Rendered by render_scenes.py,",
    "never hand-edited into OBS: placeholders {{MEDIA}} {{OVERLAY}} are filled at",
    "deploy time so Arch paths and VPS paths never leak into each other.",
    "Role mapping (daemon drives left, OBS shows right):",
    "  STARTING -> SMILE | Starting   (starting.html hold + IDENT clip source)",
    "  PROGRAM  -> SMILE | Meet       (PLAYOUT_A/B local files + ticker + watermark.",
    "                                   meet.html itself is NOT on air; the scene is",
    "                                   named for its deck position.)",
    "  LIVE     -> SMILE | Q&A        (SRT cam/screen sources + speaking.html overlay",
    "                                   + ticker; floating q&a.html bubbles toggled",
    "                                   for audience segments.)",
    "  TECHDIFF -> SMILE | Tech Diffs (fault framing per SCENES.md: names the problem,",
    "                                   bar fills while we work.)",
    "  OFFAIR   -> SMILE | Off Air    (maintenance harbour. Never edited.)",
    "  END      -> SMILE | End Credits(intentional shutdown.)",
    "UNTESTED AGAINST REAL OBS (no Xvfb on the lab box yet): schema follows the",
    "documented collection layout; render_scenes.py --check enforces internal",
    "consistency only. First OBS load is an explicit verification step.",
    "BROWSER SHUTDOWN IS FALSE EVERYWHERE, DELIBERATELY. shutdown:true unloads",
    "a page the moment its scene hides; headless first paint then costs MINUTES",
    "(measured 4-6 min on 2 shared cores), i.e. every scene cut airs blank.",
    "Resident browsers cost RAM; blank cuts cost the station. RAM is cheaper;",
    "bake-static (debrief 14) is what reduces the count, not unloading."
  ],
  "name": "SMILE Station",
  "current_scene": "SMILE | Off Air",
  "current_program_scene": "SMILE | Off Air",
  "current_transition": "Fade",
  "transition_duration": 300,
  "scene_order": [
    {"name": "SMILE | Starting"},
    {"name": "SMILE | Meet"},
    {"name": "SMILE | Q&A"},
    {"name": "SMILE | Tech Diffs"},
    {"name": "SMILE | Off Air"},
    {"name": "SMILE | End Credits"}
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {"name": "Fade", "id": "fade_transition", "settings": {}},
    {"name": "Cut", "id": "cut_transition", "settings": {}}
  ],
  "sources": [
    {"name": "SMILE | Starting", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "OB Starting Page", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "IDENT", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},
    {"name": "SMILE | Meet", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "PLAYOUT_A", "visible": false, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "PLAYOUT_B", "visible": false, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "MOD Ticker", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 1004.0}},
      {"name": "MOD Watermark", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},
    {"name": "SMILE | Q&A", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "SRT Cam", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "SRT Screen", "visible": false, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "OB Speaking", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}},
      {"name": "MOD Ticker", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 1004.0}},
      {"name": "MOD Watermark", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},
    {"name": "SMILE | Tech Diffs", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "OB Tech Diffs", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},
    {"name": "SMILE | Off Air", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "OB Off Air", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},
    {"name": "SMILE | End Credits", "id": "scene", "settings": {"items": [
      {"name": "OB End Credits", "visible": true, "pos": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0}}
    ]}},

    {"name": "OB Starting Page", "id": "browser_source", "settings": {
      "url": "{{OVERLAY}}/starting.html", "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "fps": 30, "shutdown": false}},
    {"name": "IDENT", "id": "ffmpeg_source", "settings": {
